# E §4.2 Holes in the walk, L §4.4 A movement takes a day (tally 2.3, #247; the plan's §8.2, P31's carve-out goes whole;
# planner/hd/hd5.tally): a refusal beside a hole day is what it is beside any hole day: the hole before the refused
# movement's day, the refusal from it on, for a window's hole day (other) as for a ? day (konto). Before: o0420 and
# o0509 were 500.00 and 600.00 PLN (the window had ended).
=== m.tally
model hd5
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source card "invented"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place other: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input pay: money PLN
input zero: num
input pd: date
input w: date
input bad_day: date
move pay_x: transfers
  on pd
  leg cash from world to konto amount pay
move pay_w: transfers
  on w
  leg cash from world to other amount pay
move bad: transfers
  on bad_day
  leg cash from world to konto amount round(pay / zero, minor(PLN), half-up)
move bad2: transfers
  on bad_day
  leg cash from world to other amount round(pay / zero, minor(PLN), half-up)
version v_card
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  pay = 100.00 PLN "c"
  zero = 0 "c"
  pd = ?"which day is the pay?" "c"
  w = window(2026-04-28, 2026-05-03) "c"
  bad_day = 2026-05-10 "c"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"
  opening[other] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"
ask k0509: bal(konto, 2026-05-09)
ask k0531: bal(konto, 2026-05-31)
ask o0509: bal(other, 2026-05-09)
ask o0531: bal(other, 2026-05-31)
ask o0420: bal(other, 2026-04-20)
=== expect
k0509: ?"which day is the pay?" (pd)
  cut 2026-04-20
k0531: refused: RUN-DIV division by zero
  cut 2026-04-20
o0420: ?"date within window(2026-04-28, 2026-05-03) not precise enough for the day of pay_w" (w)
  unknown day: w
  cut 2026-04-20
o0509: ?"date within window(2026-04-28, 2026-05-03) not precise enough for the day of pay_w" (w)
  unknown day: w
  cut 2026-04-20
o0531: refused: RUN-DIV division by zero
  cut 2026-04-20
